            {text="Why did the Russian farmer bring a ladder to the vodka distillery? Because he heard the spirits were high! Hahahahahaha!", sound="PALVP_3DE73E0166F900788BE5", weight=1, durationMs=8281},
            {text="Two cows were standing in a field. Have you heard that mad cow disease is going around? Ask the first. Yeah. The other cow replied, Makes me glad I'm a penguin. Hehehe.", sound="PALVP_D7FDE21D791DAD01F391", weight=1, durationMs=9326},
